                                                "sense_id": "bdf904e1-03c3-344f-bdd4-1e892344ebb3",
                                                "text": "He maintained all the cars, tractors and trucks belonging to the estate, but when he changed his greasy boilersuit for a chauffeur's uniform he looked like the original Jeeves, driving off in the Daimler to meet guests from the station."
